							<strong class="font-semibold text-ink">How many words take 2, 5, 10, or 15 minutes to read out loud?</strong> At 183 WPM, a 2-minute read-aloud is about 366 words, 5 minutes is 915 words, 10 minutes is 1,830 words, and 15 minutes covers roughly 2,745 words (or ~2,250 words at a relaxed 150 WPM presentation pace).
